          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For a standard 2BHK flat in Panvel, turnkey interior packages range between ₹5.2 Lakhs to ₹7.8 Lakhs, while premium 3BHK and township luxury apartments range from ₹8.0 Lakhs to ₹13.5 Lakhs+, backed by transparent itemized BOQ billing and direct factory pricing."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which mega-townships and localities in Panvel do you serve?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We provide comprehensive turnkey interior design across all Panvel nodes, including Hiranandani Fortune City, Marathon Nexzone, Indiabulls Greens & Park, Godrej City Panvel, Kalpataru Parkcity / Riverside, Wadhwa Wise City, Sai World City (Palaspe Phata), New Panvel (East & West Sectors 1 to 19), Khandeshwar, and Karanjade."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How do you protect Panvel homes from heavy foothill monsoon dampness?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Because Panvel sits close to the Sahyadri mountain foothills (Prabalmachi/Karnala) experiencing heavy monsoon rainfall, we exclusively use IS:710 certified Boiling Water Proof (BWP) Marine Plywood with automated German CNC PUR hot-melt edge banding and anti-corrosion SS 304 / Hettich hardware."
          }
