          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. We execute complete home interior design, modular kitchens, custom wardrobes, false ceilings, and structural civil renovations for residential societies across New Panvel East & West, Old Panvel, Karanjade, and Khandeshwar."
          }
        },
