          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much does an IS:710 Marine Plywood modular kitchen cost in Panvel?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "An IS:710 BWP Marine Plywood modular kitchen in Panvel costs between ₹1.4 Lakhs to ₹2.2 Lakhs for an L-shape layout and ₹2.0 Lakhs to ₹3.2 Lakhs for parallel or island configurations with German soft-close fittings and high-gloss acrylic shutters."
          }
